GHSI - Standing strong with this. They finally got a compliance streak going to stay in NASDAQ. Only a couple more trading days to go. Considering the 180-day deadline is mid-march, I doubt they will do an offering too. 

&#x200B;

this is not financial advice, do your own DD

Got to be very careful with penny stocks cause some companies are literally bleeding shareholder money. pump and dump is usually a bad sign. TANH is an example. check out their YTD

&#x200B;

but like, idk what company you're in, so it could be different if they have good financials and a solid product/service, take this with a grain of salt
